## README Sections (Strict Order)

### 1. Project Overview

- What the repo is: production SRE reference, not a throwaway demo
- Who it's for: platform engineers, SREs, portfolio reviewers
- Production bar vs demo: digest-only, policies enforced, SLOs, game day, teardown validated
- Badges: only if CI exists — no placeholder badges

### 2. Architecture

- Flow: Git → GitHub Actions (WIF) → Artifact Registry → Argo CD → GKE → observability → PagerDuty
- Include Mermaid or ASCII diagram
- Reference `ARCHITECTURE.md` and `docs/architecture/overview.md`

```mermaid
flowchart LR
  GH[GitHub] --> GHA[GitHub Actions + WIF]
  GHA --> AR[Artifact Registry]
  AR --> AC[Argo CD]
  AC --> GKE[Private GKE]
  GKE --> OBS[OTel / Grafana / Cloud Monitoring]
  OBS --> PD[PagerDuty]
```

