### 10. Deployment

- CI builds, scans, signs, pushes digest to AR
- PR updates manifest with digest
- Review + merge
- **Manual Argo CD sync** (deliberate promotion)
- Binary Authorization at admission
- Smoke: `curl -I https://boutique.biroltilki.art`

### 11. CI/CD

Pipeline stages:

```
Build → Trivy (fail critical/high) → push AR (digest) → cosign sign + attest
  → manifest digest PR → review/merge → manual Argo sync → Binary Auth → smoke check
```

Workflow files: `.github/workflows/build-scan-sign.yml`, `manifest-digest-pr.yml`, `ci.yml`

### 12. GitOps

- Argo CD at `argocd.boutique.biroltilki.art`
- Manual sync policy — no surprise deploys
- Namespaces: `boutique`, `argocd`, `monitoring`, `kyverno`, `external-secrets`
- App-of-apps: `gitops/bootstrap/root-app.yaml`

### 13. Monitoring

| Capability | Backend |
|------------|---------|
| SLOs | Cloud Monitoring (browse 99.9%, checkout 99.95%) |
| Burn alerts | Multi-window → PagerDuty + runbook link |
| Dashboards | Grafana |
| Traces | Cloud Trace (OTel) |
| Uptime | Cloud Monitoring check on `boutique.biroltilki.art` |
| Logs | Cloud Logging; log-based metrics |

Runbooks: `docs/sre/runbooks/`

### 14. Security

- **CI → GCP:** WIF (no long-lived SA keys)
- **Pod → GCP:** Workload Identity
- **Secrets:** ESO + Secret Manager; Kyverno blocks plain Secrets
- **Images:** digest-only, cosign, Binary Authorization
- **Network:** NetworkPolicy default-deny; Cloud Armor at edge
- **Repo:** pre-commit + gitleaks

→ Details: [SECURITY.md](SECURITY.md), [docs/security/](docs/security/)

### 15. Testing

- Pre-commit and CI: lint, Kyverno policy tests, manifest validation
- Alert test: fire test policy → PagerDuty incident
- Game days: `scripts/game-days/`, `docs/sre/game-days/`
- Smoke: HTTPS + checkout flow on live URL

